Package: cybroid-edition-developer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CybroidOS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://cybroid.com/cybroidos
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cybroid-plasma (>= @VERSION@), git, build-essential, gdb, clang, cmake, make, shellcheck, python3-venv, python3-pip, golang, rustc, cargo, nodejs, npm, sqlite3, httpie, jq, podman, distrobox
Description: CybroidOS Developer: for engineers who build software
 Toolchains and containers ready on first boot: Git, GCC and Clang with
 CMake and GDB, Python, Go, Rust, Node.js, SQLite, HTTPie and jq, Podman
 and Distrobox. Editors such as VSCodium install from the App Centre.
 .
 The same CybroidOS as every edition (look, updates, Hangar), with these
 tools added. An installed CybroidOS becomes this edition by installing this
 package; several editions can be installed together.
